id=belleui_all
name=BelleUI - the whole set
version=v0.2
versionCode=2
author=BelleUI
description=Installs the Belle launcher, every Belle app and the Belle System UI (status bar, pull-down, power menu, volume) as system apps, gives them the access they need at boot, and (optionally) makes the Belle launcher and keyboard the defaults. Android 11+.
